@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core
@workflow = account-opening
@instanceKey = REPLACE_WITH_INSTANCE_KEY

### Start instance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
x-device-id: dev-mac-001
x-request-id: req-{{$guid}}

{
  "session": "session-{{$guid}}",
  "customer": {
    "ownerUserId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
    "firstName": "Ada",
    "lastName": "Lovelace",
    "preferredLanguage": "tr"
  }
}

### Get current state (long-polling for view + data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/state
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### --- Step 1: Choose account type (only one of the four runs per instance) ---

### Select Demand Deposit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/select-demand-deposit
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Select Time Deposit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/select-time-deposit
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Select Investment Account
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/select-investment-account
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Select Savings Account
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/select-savings-account
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### --- Step 2: Submit type-specific details (only one runs per instance) ---

### Submit Demand Deposit details
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/submit-demand-deposit-info
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{
  "accountName": "Daily Spending",
  "currency": "TRY",
  "branchCode": "1001",
  "initialDeposit": 500,
  "accountPurpose": "personal-banking",
  "notifications": {
    "smsNotifications": true,
    "emailNotifications": true,
    "pushNotifications": false
  }
}

### Submit Time Deposit details
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/submit-time-deposit-info
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{
  "accountName": "12m TRY Deposit",
  "currency": "TRY",
  "branchCode": "1001",
  "initialDeposit": 25000,
  "termMonths": 12,
  "maturityInstruction": "auto-renew",
  "notifications": {
    "smsNotifications": true,
    "emailNotifications": true,
    "pushNotifications": true
  }
}

### Submit Investment Account details
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/submit-investment-account-info
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{
  "accountName": "Portfolio Account",
  "currency": "USD",
  "branchCode": "1001",
  "initialDeposit": 10000,
  "riskProfile": "medium",
  "investmentExperience": "intermediate",
  "investmentObjective": "growth",
  "notifications": {
    "smsNotifications": true,
    "emailNotifications": true,
    "pushNotifications": true
  }
}

### Submit Savings Account details
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/submit-savings-account-info
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{
  "accountName": "Vacation Fund",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "branchCode": "1001",
  "initialDeposit": 500,
  "savingsGoalAmount": 15000,
  "targetDate": "2027-06-01",
  "autoTransferFromAccount": "TR330006100519786457841326",
  "notifications": {
    "smsNotifications": true,
    "emailNotifications": true,
    "pushNotifications": false
  }
}

### --- Step 3: Approve summary (manual transition; final confirmation popup view) ---
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/approve-account-opening
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{
  "confirmed": true,
  "termsAccepted": true,
  "privacyPolicyAccepted": true
}

### --- Step 4: Wait for automatic policy-validation + account-creation (poll state) ---
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/state
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Cancel at any user-driven step
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/transitions/cancel-account-opening
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Retry a failed transition
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/retry
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Query instances by state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances?state=account-opening-success
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### ============================================================
### LOV / Lookup function tests (called by the renderer on x-lov / x-lookup)
### ============================================================

### Call the get-branches LOV with cascade filter (currency)
### Cascade: response should change when currency changes (TRY vs USD branches)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/get-branches
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{
  "currency": "TRY"
}

### Call the get-branch-detail lookup (single branch enrichment)
### Returns: { data: { code, name: {en,tr}, address, phone, manager } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instanceKey}}/functions/get-branch-detail
Content-Type: application/json
user_reference: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

{
  "code": "1001"
}

### ============================================================
### Direct mock endpoint tests (bypass workflow runtime; hit the mock layer)
### Useful when wiring up MockLab — verify the contract before exercising x-lov/x-lookup.
### ============================================================

### Mock — branches filtered by currency
GET http://localhost:3001/api/banking/lov/branches?currency=TRY
Accept: application/json

### Mock — single branch detail
GET http://localhost:3001/api/banking/lookup/branches?code=1001
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================
### x-validation note
### ============================================================
### accountName has `x-validation: { rule: "unique-account-name" }`.
### This is NOT an HTTP endpoint — the renderer calls
###   delegate.onValidationRequest("accountName", value, formData)
### in the host (Forge). The host returns either null (valid) or a localised error
### string. Mock this in the Forge extension's delegate implementation.
